<title>CANADA: Suncor cuts Canada posted oil prices.</title>
<headline>Suncor cuts Canada posted oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suncor Energy Inc said on Thursday it lowered the price it would pay for some grades of crude oil by C$3.00/cubic metre or C$0.48/barrel, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The new prices were listed as follows:</p>
<p>Edmonton light sweet C$162.00/cubic metre, or C$25.76/barrel</p>
<p>Cromer light sour C$154.00/cubic metre, or C$24.48/barrel</p>
<p>Midale at Cromer C$138.00/cubic metre, or C$21.94/barrel</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
</text>
